vents{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":4507,"digest":"sha256:5f46040f7819af1b8b0935421fb365e59a5d5b20b1fa10c00948883eebde240a","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-11T22:03:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T22:03:39Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/releases/download/shared-p4-beta.1/RELEASE-NOTES.md"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/releases/assets/631923092","id":631923092,"node_id":"RA_kwDOS0ubjc4lqmGU","name":"SHA256SUMS.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"dvucinozd","id":58355393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzU1Mzkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58355393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd","html_url":"https://github.com/dvucinozd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1216,"digest":"sha256:68b4e7eea78d69c0dedfbcacea1fc609334cd90ecf217359e9c83fd013e23a2f","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-11T22:03:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T22:03:39Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/releases/download/shared-p4-beta.1/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/tarball/shared-p4-beta.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/zipball/shared-p4-beta.1","body":"One canonical ESP32-P4 core now serves **JC4880, JC1060 and M3**, with isolated\nboard providers and shared audio/deck/library/controller/UI/web/signed OTA code.\n\nThis is a **contributor beta / GitHub prerelease**, not unrestricted production\nacceptance. Stable **M2.5**, its existing assets and public OTA channels remain\nunchanged. No device was updated as part of this publication.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Shared startup/components/BSP contracts, board/project/source identity and\n  signed OTA health/rollback boundaries.\n- Unified Rekordbox metadata, playlist/artwork, memory/source/local cues,\n  persistent media identity and explicit legacy-cue migration.\n- Common LOAD LOCK, seek/preroll/CUE/loop transport with M3 PCM/FIR/cache fixes\n  and board-specific waveform scheduling.\n- Controller profile v2/v3/v4 runtime, MIDI/LED epochs and USB audio lifecycle;\n  corrected physical-root FIFO admission for Hercules on JC and M3 policies.\n- English README reconciled; all 20 original image/embed references preserved.\n\n## Downloads and installation\n\n| Board | Embedded version | Image bytes | Download |\n| --- | --- | ---: | --- |\n| JC4880 | `M2.5-215-g40e72fcb` | 2,607,712 | `jc4880-beta-kit.zip` or signed `main-deck-p4.ddjota` |\n| JC1060 | `M2.5-215-g40e72fcb` | 2,666,368 | `jc1060-beta-kit.zip` or signed `main-deck-jc1060.ddjota` |\n| M3 | `M3-dev-g40e72fcbf403` | 2,600,960 | `m3-beta-kit.zip` or signed `main-deck-m3.ddjota` |\n\nExact source/tag commit: `40e72fcbf403a1650185a4c64509dd11bba9f73f`\n([merged PR #46](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/pull/46)).\nVerify `SHA256SUMS.txt`, the signed release manifest and kit inventories.\nEach kit includes its signed OTA, raw recovery BIN, board/source/configuration,\nbootloader/partition/initial OTA data, flashing arguments and controller profiles.\nSeparate debug ZIPs retain matching ELF/MAP. No private signing material is included.\n\nStop both decks, keep power stable and upload **only the matching board's\n`.ddjota`** through its signed local OTA UI. Raw BIN and partition/bootloader\nartifacts are for verified wired provisioning/recovery, not web OTA. Cross-board\npackages are not interchangeable. The M3 development version disables automatic\npull discovery and ordinary M3 uses **FLX4 USB2 FS / storage USB3 HS**. These\nassets do not retain the experimental Hercules/S2 USB3-controller port swap.\nHistorical M3 `main-deck-p4` requires the preserving wired identity migration.\n\n[OTA instructions](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/shared-p4-beta.1/docs/OTA-UPDATE.md) ·\n[JC1060 handoff for Kayrosen](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/shared-p4-beta.1/docs/JC1060_BETA_HANDOFF_20261011.md) ·\n[Board policies](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/shared-p4-beta.1/docs/SHARED_P4_BOARDS.md).\n\n## Validation and limits\n\nAll three **fresh ESP-IDF 6.0.2 builds**, board/project/source/component isolation,\nunchanged lock and 0x380000 image-budget checks pass on the exact beta source.\nAll three bundle/manifest ECDSA-P256 signatures, embedded identities/ELF hashes\nand ZIP inventories verify. Production and test source is unchanged from the\nfully qualified `722bb976` baseline (required fixtures, no host SKIP, eight root\npolicies and captured JC/M3-HS stream regressions). UI simulator scope and source\nequivalence are documented; no new beta physical UI claim is made. The auxiliary\nUSB spike's historical missing-dependency CI build defect is locally repaired.\nCurrent hosted CI remains operator-skipped under the earlier quota decision.\n\n- **These exact beta assets are not installed or physically accepted.**\n- JC4880's earlier named short control/audio/MT/loop/seek/CUE/PFL blocks passed\n  on `e22ff334`. Its long soak is explicitly **waived / NOT RUN**, not PASS.\n- JC1060 physical testing is **NOT RUN**, deferred to contributor Kayrosen.\n- Historical M3/Hercules/S2 hours retain their exact image/configuration/rate\n  scope; they do not qualify these packages. S2 remains operator-closed.\n- Output-late findings remain monitoring observations; no zero-late claim.\n  Wider real-media, transport and individual pad/FX/LED gates remain partial/unrun.\n- Recorder, alternate DJ UI and M3 Ethernet/Pro DJ Link remain experimental or\n  disabled in ordinary builds.\n\n[Validation matrix](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/shared-p4-beta.1/docs/validation/SHARED_P4_FINAL_BUILD_MATRIX_20261011.md) ·\n[Delivery record](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/master/docs/validation/SHARED_P4_BETA_1_20261011.md).\n"}